(property "Migration Limits" "237 kohm, 0.1%, 25 ppm/C and 50 V match stated historical values. Actual ordinary rating is 63 mW at 70 C ambient, not an unconditional 62.5 mW. Package is 0402. No project pulse or 60 V survival qualification, substitute approval, or legacy verification is inherited." (at 2.54 -1.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide))
(property "Part Origin" "Exact-MPN symbol created by Steve. Reuses the unchanged reviewed OCPM managed R_0402_1005Metric footprint and generic model under the standard passive-package exception. TE CPF0402 nominal body 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.30 mm, two nonpolar end terminals. Shared IPC-style lands 0.54 x 0.64 mm at X +/-0.51 mm, gap 0.48 mm. TE recommended 0402 lands are 0.50 x 0.60 mm with 0.50 mm gap. Shared lands are slightly larger and overlap the intended terminal positions; retained approved generic package, not an exact redrawing of TE lands. Generic model 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.35 mm is 0.05 mm taller than nominal CPF body. Approximate visualization only; actual height/tolerances remain the datasheet values. Original unique draft package and evidence retained in private shared-reuse migration recovery storage. No prior Spec verification is transferred." (at 2.54 -1.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide))
